    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ levels of proving potential</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >315 to be exact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 sections and 6 challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A bullet hell where you actually have to move</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the finish of each level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail a level and you get to retry it instantly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are short and require quick thinking and quick reaction time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't get to sit around waiting for the bullets to come to you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full original soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full soundtrack is provided with the game in high quality WAV format, no extra charge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Wanna prove yourself?</u></strong></p>",
